Welcome to fielddEDU, the free learning series that helps you master running your business.

Learn how to set up service areas and shop zones inside your fieldd CRM. 

Whether you run a mobile business or operate multiple storefronts, this tutorial will help you manage travel zones, assign staff, add fees, and restrict bookings by region, keeping your operations tight and efficient.

Clear service areas reduce travel time, limit customer confusion, and create a smoother booking experience. Watch how fieldd’s dynamic zone creation, travel charges, tax rates, and live tracking can level up how you operate.

When you’re ready to master your business, we’re here to help. https://fieldd.co

